# Preview once

Do not start a local server or open the browser after every edit or follow-up prompt.

Make the requested changes first. Serve and check the site once, after that work is in place.

## When to preview

- One message with several changes: preview a single time at the end.
- A short follow-up (copy, a link, layout): edit the files and stop. Do not serve again.
- Preview when the user asks to see the site, or when a batch of changes is finished and there is something user-visible to check.

## How

From the repo root:

```bash
python3 -m http.server 8000
```

Open the affected pages, then stop the server.
